r fun vibe inside and always solid music. Games for entertainment, some of which are free (like big connect 4 or Jenga) There's a big garage door that connects inside game room to outdoor patio. Great drink specials and the bar food is actually freaking DELICIOUS. We've had the BBQ nachos, cheese curds, and fried pickles-all quite delicious versions of classic bar foods. There's also a club-vibing lounge in the back that opens late on weekend nights (I believe it's 11 or 12 on Friday and Saturday nights-but don't quote me on that) - it gets super packed bc the musi..."},{"business_id":"99dN-202N0EzRqdaOA_eRQ","review_id":"RDc1Vs9a8UwbeD4BjeDCxg","date":"2013-09-25T09:52:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9395283460617065,"text_excerpt":"This is a neat place. Love the large games you can play and also the arcade games. Burger was great but nothing totally memorable. LOVE the beer selection. Great place to hang out and chill and drink beer. Can't wait to move back home and put this place in our regular hangout location."},{"business_id":"99dN-202N0EzRqdaOA_eRQ","review_id":"LLVR4MFgqotOghXc4do-Yg","date":"2013-10-12T12:45:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9357912540435791,"text_excerpt":"Tried this place for the first time last week. Bar food mostly - burgers, sandwiches, salads, etc. However, I was pleasantly surprised! The food was very good and the wait staff very accommodating. Definitely will go back. Lots of old pinball machines line the walls."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"99dN-202N0EzRqdaOA_eRQ","photo_id":"ZbT5zfL-RXcyoa-ZhdG-Cw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ZbT5zfL-RXcyoa-ZhdG-Cw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.846054196357727},{"business_id":"99dN-202N0EzRqdaOA_eRQ","photo_id":"spllZ5GAXOsNi7tLCuei2g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/spllZ5GAXOsNi7tLCuei2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8265848755836487},{"business_id":"99dN-202N0EzRqdaOA_eRQ","photo_id":"HUxtAtvDUb8Fy9WO2gDxAw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HUxtAt